================================================================================
SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
================================================================================

The MIT License below applies ONLY to original works authored by the Arcadia V2
team (vyrriox and contributors). Specifically, it covers:

  - KubeJS scripts written for this modpack (kubejs/server_scripts,
    kubejs/startup_scripts, kubejs/client_scripts)
  - Custom KubeJS assets we authored (textures, sounds, lang files
    under kubejs/assets/arcadia/ and related arcadia_* namespaces)
  - Custom data files we authored (datapack overrides under kubejs/data/,
    config overlays under config/arcadia*, defaultconfigs/arcadia*)
  - The FTB Quests pack contents written by the team
    (config/ftbquests/quests/*)
  - In-house mods built for Arcadia and shipped under our control
    (arcadia-patch-create, arcadia-* mod jars where we are the authors)
  - Documentation, guides, READMEs and CHANGELOGs in this repository

It DOES NOT apply to anything we did not author. See the THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
section below.

